  "instructions": {
    "mutations": "Deep-copy base; apply JSON-pointer sets; recompute each indicated rehash_messages index own message digest, then only outer digest. schema=false makes no supplemental claim. schema=true/supplemental=false must fail relational or recursive digest validation.",
